# FestPilot — local secrets / deploy credentials TEMPLATE.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (same folder) and fill the values. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
# All of this is FREE tier — no paid plan needed for V1 (DEC-037).

# --- Cloudflare deploy (REQUIRED for live deploy; unblocks Phases 0-3) ---
# Create the token at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#   -> "Create Token" -> template "Edit Cloudflare Workers" -> then ADD: D1 (Edit) and Cloudflare Pages (Edit).
#   -> Account Resources: Include = your account. Copy the token once (shown only once).
# Account ID: Cloudflare dash -> Workers & Pages -> right sidebar "Account ID" (or run `npx wrangler whoami`).
# The deploy step sources this file and exports these so `wrangler` authenticates non-interactively.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# --- Admin guard (the build GENERATES this; you don't need to set it) ---
# A strong random string guarding POST /admin/* . Left blank => the build creates one + `wrangler secret put`.
ADMIN_TOKEN=

# --- Firebase (REQUIRED from Phase 4 for auth; Phase 3 for push) — Spark (free) plan ---
# Worker only needs the PROJECT ID to verify ID tokens (it fetches Google's public certs; no service account).
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# For server-side FCM send (push). Paste the path to the service account JSON, or set it as a Worker secret:
#   wrangler secret put FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
